}

## Effect of a completed father-speaks command on the real world (once per command).
sp {muddy-children*apply*father-speaks*environment-effect
   :o-support
   (state <s> ^problem-space.name muddy-children ^superstate nil ^world <w> ^io.output-link.perform-action <pa>)
   (<pa> ^name father-speaks ^status complete ^argument1 <t-h> -^effect-applied true)
   (<w> ^anchored-world true ^objects <objs>)
   (<objs> ^stage <t>)
   (<t> ^object-handle $ <t-h>)
   (<t> ^step <t-step>)
-->
   (<t> ^step <t-step> - (+ <t-step> 1))
   (<pa> ^effect-applied true)
   (write |Father: at least one of you has mud on your forehead| (crlf))
}

